<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cresud started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cresud started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Deutsche Morgan Grenfell analyst Martin Pradier has started coverage of Argentine agribusiness company Cresud SA with a rating of buy.</p>
<p>-- In a May 19 report, he wrote that Cresud was attractive in part because it was considered a play on assets and agricultural prices and because of its &quot;proven management team.&quot;</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
